# Please say it again in Russian: повторите
subtitle: "Ask a Russian to repeat, slow down, tell, show or wait: six request words that end in те for вы, and drop it for a friend."
teaches: ["phrases/asking-to-repeat","grammar/requests"]
thumb: "band \"Too fast? Say this.\" note \"Повтори́те!\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Directions in Russian: направо, налево, прямо","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/42-russian-directions.cast"}

## Please say it again in Russian: повторите
level: basic

    icon i_talk size 140 set twemoji x 350 y 560 or ["speech balloon","person"] icon_look picture of "speaking head" hidden true
    icon i_dizzy size 140 set twemoji x 650 y 560 or ["dizzy face","confused face"] icon_look picture of "face with spiral eyes" hidden true
