    text hello "здра́вствуйте" #3d3833 say true say_voice b colors {"те$":"#3d8a5a"} x 500 y 335 font_size 56 hidden true
    glossed ex1 "Повтори́те ещё раз, пожа́луйста." say_voice b gloss ["say it again","one more","time","please"] show_gloss under x 500 y 225 font_size 50 hidden true
    glossed ex2 "Говори́те ме́дленнее, пожа́луйста." say_voice a gloss ["speak","more slowly","please"] show_gloss under x 500 y 225 font_size 50 hidden true
    glossed ex3 "Скажи́те, пожа́луйста, где апте́ка?" say_voice a gloss ["tell me","please","where","pharmacy"] show_gloss under x 500 y 225 font_size 50 hidden true
    glossed ex4 "Покажи́те, пожа́луйста, кни́гу." say_voice a gloss ["show me","please","the book"] show_gloss under x 500 y 225 font_size 50 hidden true
    glossed ex5 "Подожди́те, пожа́луйста!" say_voice a gloss ["wait","please"] show_gloss under x 500 y 225 font_size 50 hidden true
    glossed ex6 "Да́йте, пожа́луйста, хлеб." say_voice b gloss ["give me","please","bread"] show_gloss under x 500 y 225 font_size 50 hidden true
    icon tom size 170 set twemoji x 95 y 450 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "Tom" #8f887c x 95 y 320 font_size 34 hidden true
    icon masha size 170 set twemoji x 905 y 450 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 905 y 320 font_size 34 hidden true
    group speakers members ["tom","tom_name","masha","masha_name"] hidden true

    card title "Please say it again"

A: What do you say in Russian when someone talks too fast?
    draw i_talk i_dizzy

B: First, words from lesson twenty-two: я не понима́ю. I don't understand.
    draw g_ne

A: Then ask for help: повтори́те, пожа́луйста. Please say it again.
    draw g_rep

    erase i_talk i_dizzy g_ne g_rep

    draw r_rep_g r_rep_v

A: Повтори́те is a request: one word that asks someone to do  (@draw r_gov_q r_sk_q r_pok_q r_pod_q r_dai_q@)something. Here are six to get you by.

B: Add ещё раз, once more: повтори́те ещё раз, пожа́луйста.
    draw ex1

    erase ex1 r_gov_q

A: Too fast? Говори́те ме́дленнее: speak more slowly.
    draw r_gov_g r_gov_v ex2

    draw l7

B: You know говори́те from lesson seven: вы говори́те по-англи́йски? Do you speak English?
    highlight r_gov_v l7_w_2 effect underline color #c9871a

A: Here the very same word asks someone to speak.
    highlight ex2_w_1 l7_w_2 effect underline color #c9871a

    erase r_rep_v r_gov_v l7

    draw r_rep_c r_gov_c

    draw hello

B: Now look at the end: те is the вы ending, as in здра́вствуйте, and every request to вы has it.
    highlight hello effect underline color #c9871a part те$

    erase ex2 r_sk_q hello

A: Скажи́те: tell me. Скажи́те, пожа́луйста, где апте́ка? Tell me, please, where's the pharmacy?
    draw r_sk_g r_sk_c ex3

B: That's how you start a question to a stranger: скажи́те, пожа́луйста.
    highlight ex3_w_1 ex3_w_2 effect underline color #c9871a

    erase ex3 r_pok_q

A: Покажи́те: show me. In a shop: покажи́те, пожа́луйста, кни́гу.
    draw r_pok_g r_pok_c ex4

B: Кни́га became кни́гу: the object ending, as in да́йте ры́бу at the market.
    highlight ex4_w_3 effect underline color #c9871a part у$

    erase ex4 r_pod_q

A: Подожди́те: wait. Подожди́те, пожа́луйста, when you need a moment.
    draw r_pod_g r_pod_c ex5

    erase ex5 r_dai_q

B: And да́йте, from the market: да́йте, пожа́луйста, хлеб. Give me some bread, please.
    draw r_dai_g r_dai_c ex6

    erase ex6

A: Six requests, six те endings: each one for вы, a stranger or more than one person.
    highlight r_rep_c r_gov_c r_sk_c r_pok_c r_pod_c r_dai_c effect glow color #c9871a part те$

B: To a friend, you say ты, so drop the те: повтори́, скажи́, подожди́.
    draw h_ty r_rep_t r_sk_t r_pod_t

    quiz "Your friend talks too fast. What do you say? Pick one." store chk voice b
        right: A friend gets ты, so no те: говори́.
        wrong: Говорю́ means I speak, and говори́те is for вы. To a friend: говори́.
        * Говори́те ме́дленнее!
        + Говори́ ме́дленнее!
        * Говорю́ ме́дленнее!

    draw r_gov_t r_pok_t

A: Говори́ and покажи́ too: these ты forms end in и, and the stress falls on it.
    highlight r_rep_t r_gov_t r_sk_t r_pok_t r_pod_t effect glow color #c9871a

    draw r_dai_t

B: Да́йте is the odd one: to a friend, just дай, ending in й, not и.
    highlight r_dai_t effect glow color #c9871a part й

    hide r_rep_g r_gov_g r_sk_g r_pok_g r_pod_g r_dai_g r_rep_c r_gov_c r_sk_c r_pok_c r_pod_c r_dai_c r_rep_t r_gov_t r_sk_t r_pok_t r_pod_t r_dai_t h_ty

B: Now I ask Tom out, and I talk far too fast.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name parallel true

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Том, за́втра в семь мы идём в рестора́н. Ты мо́жешь?","gloss":"Tom, tomorrow at seven we're going to a restaurant. Can you?"},{"by":"a","text":"Подожди́! Я не понима́ю. Повтори́, пожа́луйста.","gloss":"Wait! I don't understand. Say it again, please."},{"by":"b","text":"За́втра в семь мы идём в рестора́н!","gloss":"Tomorrow at seven we're going to a restaurant!"},{"by":"a","text":"Ещё раз, пожа́луйста. Говори́ ме́дленнее!","gloss":"Once more, please. Speak more slowly!"},{"by":"b","text":"За́втра… в семь… в рестора́н.","gloss":"Tomorrow… at seven… to a restaurant."},{"by":"a","text":"А, понима́ю! Могу́!","gloss":"Ah, I understand! I can!"}] size 1.3 x 500 width 640

    draw talk

A: Masha is my friend, so ты: подожди́ and повтори́, with no те.
    highlight talk_2_words effect underline color #c9871a part Подожди́

    draw talk

    draw talk

B: Ещё раз, and говори́ ме́дленнее. So I slow down.
    highlight talk_4_words effect underline color #c9871a part ме́дленнее

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide speakers

    icon t1_pic size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["speaking head"] icon_look picture of ear

    quiz "You didn't catch what a stranger said. Ask them to say it again. Pick one." store q1 reveal.text "Повтори́те, пожа́луйста." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Повтори́те: say it again.
        wrong: Подожди́те is wait, and покажи́те is show me. Say it again is повтори́те.
        * Подожди́те, пожа́луйста.
        + Повтори́те, пожа́луйста.
        * Покажи́те, пожа́луйста.

    pause 1.2

    erase t1_pic q1_stamp

    icon t2_pic size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["speaking head"] icon_look picture of "speech balloon"

    quiz "What does скажи́те mean? Pick one." store q2 reveal.text "Скажи́те = tell me" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Tell me, as in скажи́те, пожа́луйста, где апте́ка?
        wrong: Show me is покажи́те, and wait is подожди́те. Скажи́те is tell me.
        * show me
        * wait
        + tell me

    pause 1.2

    erase t2_pic q2_stamp

    icon t3_pic size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["turtle"] icon_look picture of snail

    quiz "Ask a stranger to speak more slowly: … ме́дленнее, пожа́луйста. Which word fills the gap?" store q3 reveal.text "Говори́те ме́дленнее!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: A stranger gets вы, so the те: говори́те.
        wrong: Говори́ is for a friend, and говорю́ means I speak. A stranger gets говори́те.
        + Говори́те
        * Говори́
        * Говорю́

    pause 1.2

    erase t3_pic q3_stamp

    icon t4_pic size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["baguette bread"] icon_look picture of bread

    ask "To a friend, да́йте becomes … ? Type it." answer ["дай"] store q4 default дай reveal.text "Дай хлеб, пожа́луйста!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Дай: the odd one, ending in й.
        wrong: Да́йте drops its те, and what's left is дай.

    pause 1.2

    erase t4_pic q4_stamp

    icon t5_pic size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["hourglass not done","stopwatch"] icon_look picture of "hourglass done"

    quiz "Masha must wait a moment. What do you say to her? Pick one." store q5 reveal.text Подожди́! reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: A friend gets ты: no те, подожди́.
        wrong: Подожди́те is for вы, and покажи́ means show me. To Masha: подожди́.
        * Подожди́те!
        + Подожди́!
        * Покажи́!

    pause 1.2

    erase t5_pic q5_stamp

    show r_rep_g r_gov_g r_sk_g r_pok_g r_pod_g r_dai_g r_rep_c r_gov_c r_sk_c r_pok_c r_pod_c r_dai_c r_rep_t r_gov_t r_sk_t r_pok_t r_pod_t r_dai_t h_ty

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So a request is one word: те at the end for вы, and no те for a friend. Повтори́те, повтори́.
    highlight r_rep_c r_rep_t effect underline color #c9871a

    erase h_ty

    draw kit

B: And for the moments it all goes too fast, you have a whole kit: ещё раз, говори́те ме́дленнее, подожди́те.
    highlight kit r_gov_c r_pod_c effect glow color #c9871a

    erase r_rep_g r_gov_g r_sk_g r_pok_g r_pod_g r_dai_g r_rep_c r_gov_c r_sk_c r_pok_c r_pod_c r_dai_c r_rep_t r_gov_t r_sk_t r_pok_t r_pod_t r_dai_t kit

A: So when Russian runs away from you, you're not stuck: я не понима́ю. Повтори́те, пожа́луйста.
    icon e_dizzy size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 580 or ["slightly smiling face","grinning face"] icon_look picture of "smiling face with smiling eyes"
    glossed e_ne "Я не понима́ю." say_voice a gloss ["I","not","understand"] show_gloss under x 500 y 410 font_size 62
    glossed e_rep "Повтори́те, пожа́луйста." say_voice a gloss ["say it again","please"] show_gloss under x 500 y 255 font_size 62

B: Next time, finding your way: left, right and straight on. Пока́!
    icon e_wave size 110 set twemoji x 850 y 580 or ["raised hand"] icon_look picture of "waving hand"

